@startuml

title Distributed Tracing: one action becomes a tree of spans

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "Qt client" as qt
participant "workflow" as wf
participant "refdata" as rd
participant "iam" as iam

qt -> qt : root span 0001 of trace T
qt -> wf : traceparent 00-T-0001-01
wf -> wf : span 0002, parent 0001
wf -> rd : traceparent 00-T-0002-01
rd -> rd : span 0003, parent 0002
wf -> iam : traceparent 00-T-0002-01
iam -> iam : span 0004, parent 0002
note over qt, iam
  Each span records its start, its end and its outcome.
  The spans of trace T rebuild the call tree with timings,
  and every log line carries T and its own span id.
end note
@enduml
